nshe too was a nun, and likewise\nthe sacred veil's shadow was taken from her head.\nBut when she too was returned to the world\nagainst her will and proper custom,\nshe never removed the veil from her heart.\nThis is the radiance of great Constance,\nwho from Swabia's second wind\nbrought forth the third and final power.","startTime":255.695,"endTime":321.935,"words":[{"word":"A","start":255.695,"end":256.095},{"word":"perfect","start":256.095,"end":256.415},{"word":"life","start":256.415,"end":256.975},{"word":"and","start":256.975,"end":257.215},{"word":"high","start":257.215,"end":257.535},{"word":"merit","start":257.535,"end":258.335},{"word":"placed","start":258.335,"end":258.735},{"word":"in","start":258.735,"end":258.895},{"word":"heaven","start":258.895,"end":259.295},{"word":"a","start":259.295,"end":259.455},{"word":"lady","start":259.455,"end":260.015},{"word":"above","start":260.015,"end":260.255},{"word":"us,","start":260.255,"end":261.055},{"word":"by","start":261.055,"end":261.295},{"word":"whose","start":261.295,"end":261.615},{"word":"rule","start":261.615,"end":262.175},{"word":"people","start":262.175,"end":262.575},{"word":"in","start":262.575,"end":262.735},{"word":"your","start":262.735,"end":262.975},{"word":"world","start":262.975,"end":263.455},{"word":"dress","start":263.455,"end":263.935},{"word":"and","start":263.935,"end":264.175},{"word":"veil","start":264.175,"end":264.575},{"word":"themselves","start":264.575,"end":265.455},{"word":"to","start":265.455,"end":265.695},{"word":"watch","start":265.695,"end":266.175},{"word":"and","start":266.175,"end":266.415},{"word":"sleep","start":266.415,"end":266.975},{"word":"until","start":266.975,"end":267.375},{"word":"death","start":267.375,"end":267.775},{"word":"beside","start":267.775,"end":268.255},{"word":"that","start":268.255,"end":268.415},{"word":"Spouse","start":268.415,"end":269.215},{"word":"who","start":269.215,"end":269.375},{"word":"accepts","start":269.375,"end":270.015},{"word